                                            Table "public.ai_execution"
        Column         |           Type           | Collation | Nullable |                 Default                  
-----------------------+--------------------------+-----------+----------+------------------------------------------
 id                    | integer                  |           | not null | nextval('ai_execution_id_seq'::regclass)
